     "text": "{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"Blocking containerHost:execution makes tokenCache:credentialAccess unreachable, since that was its only parent. This also cuts off apiToken:authenticate and ssoLogin:authenticate. Blocking mailClient:execution makes rdpLogin:authenticate and vpnSession:authenticate unreachable. That in turn cuts off monitoringHost:lateralMovement, hypervisor:privilegeEscalation and fileServer:lateralMovement, because browserStore:credentialAccess is also blocked. As a result, all four parents of crownData:exfiltrate are unreachable. codeRepo:collection fails because fileServer, localAdmin and hypervisor are all unreachable. mailArchive:collection fails because printServer has no reachable parent. shareMount:collection fails because serviceAccount and secretsManager both need monitoringHost. dbReplica:collection fails because monitoringHost and hypervisor are unreachable.\"}"
    }
